#: netsetup:423 netsetup:448
msgid "The IP address you have entered is not valid."
msgstr "Alamat IP yang Anda masukkan tidak valid."

#: netsetup:425
#, sh-format
msgid ""
"There should be $ArG2 groups of numbers seperated by dots, for example:"
msgstr "Seharusnya ada $ArG2 kelompok angka yang dipisahkan oleh titik, misalnya:"

#: netsetup:428
msgid "Please correct any mistakes in the IP."
msgstr "Silakan perbaiki kesalahan apa pun pada IP tersebut."

#: netsetup:430 netsetup:447
msgid "INVALID IP"
msgstr "IP TIDAK VALID"

#: netsetup:430 netsetup:447 netsetup:551 netsetup:698 netsetup:794
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Kembali"

#: netsetup:450
msgid "Please enter a valid IPv6 address."
msgstr "Silakan masukkan alamat IPv6 yang valid."

#: netsetup:482
msgid "First, we'll need the name you'd like to give your host."
msgstr "Pertama, kami memerlukan nama yang ingin Anda berikan untuk host Anda."

#: netsetup:484
msgid "Only the base hostname is needed right now - not the domain."
msgstr "Saat ini hanya hostname dasar yang diperlukan - bukan domainnya."

#: netsetup:486
msgid "Enter hostname:"
msgstr "Masukkan hostname:"

#: netsetup:487
msgid "ENTER HOSTNAME"
msgstr "MASUKKAN HOSTNAME"

#: netsetup:487 netsetup:508 netsetup:587 netsetup:613
msgid "Exit"
msgstr "Keluar"

#: netsetup:502
msgid "Now, we need the domain name for this machine, such as:"
msgstr "Sekarang, kami memerlukan nama domain untuk mesin ini, seperti:"

#: netsetup:504
msgid "Do not supply a leading '.'"
msgstr "Jangan sertakan '.' di awal"

#: netsetup:506
msgid "Enter domain name for"
msgstr "Masukkan nama domain untuk"

#: netsetup:508
msgid "ENTER DOMAINNAME"
msgstr "MASUKKAN NAMA DOMAIN"

#: netsetup:521
msgid ""
"Some advanced networking set ups require a VLAN ID in order to connect to "
"the network."
msgstr "Beberapa pengaturan jaringan tingkat lanjut memerlukan ID VLAN agar dapat terhubung ke jaringan."

#: netsetup:523
msgid "Do you wish to configure a VLAN ID now?"
msgstr "Apakah Anda ingin mengonfigurasi ID VLAN sekarang?"

#: netsetup:525
msgid "Unless you are sure you require a VLAN ID, select 'No'."
msgstr "Kecuali Anda yakin memerlukan ID VLAN, pilih 'Tidak'."

#: netsetup:526
msgid "CONNECT VIA VLAN"
msgstr "HUBUNGKAN VIA VLAN"

#: netsetup:537 netsetup:551 netsetup:1037 netsetup:1060 netsetup:1074
#: netsetup:1104
msgid "VLAN ID"
msgstr "ID VLAN"

#: netsetup:537 netsetup:635 netsetup:677 netsetup:732 netsetup:765
#: netsetup:828 netsetup:895
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Lewati"

#: netsetup:538
msgid "Enter the VLAN ID used on this network:"
msgstr "Masukkan ID VLAN yang digunakan pada jaringan ini:"

#: netsetup:552
msgid "That doesn't appear to be a valid VLAN ID."
msgstr "Itu tampaknya bukan ID VLAN yang valid."

#: netsetup:566
msgid "CONFIGURATION TYPE FOR"
msgstr "JENIS KONFIGURASI UNTUK"

#: netsetup:569
msgid "Now we need to know how your machine connects to the network."
msgstr "Sekarang kami perlu mengetahui bagaimana mesin Anda terhubung ke jaringan."

#: netsetup:571
msgid ""
"If you have an internal network card and an assigned IP address, gateway, "
"and DNS, use the 'static IP' choice to enter these values."
msgstr "Jika Anda memiliki kartu jaringan internal dan alamat IP, gateway, serta DNS yang ditetapkan, gunakan pilihan 'IP statis' untuk memasukkan nilai-nilai tersebut."

#: netsetup:572
msgid ""
"If your IP address is assigned by a DHCP server (commonly used by cable "
"modem and DSL services), select 'DHCP'."
msgstr "Jika alamat IP Anda ditetapkan oleh server DHCP (umumnya digunakan oleh modem kabel dan layanan DSL), pilih 'DHCP'."

#: netsetup:574
msgid ""
"Select 'NetworkManager' if you would like to have the NetworkManager daemon "
"automatically handle your wired and wireless network interfaces (this is "
"simple and usually works)."
msgstr "Pilih 'NetworkManager' jika Anda ingin daemon NetworkManager secara otomatis menangani antarmuka jaringan kabel dan nirkabel Anda (ini sederhana dan biasanya berfungsi)."

#: netsetup:575
msgid ""
"IPv6 networks may also use SLAAC (Stateless Address Autoconfiguration) to "
"assign an address based on Router Advertisments."
msgstr "Jaringan IPv6 juga dapat menggunakan SLAAC (Stateless Address Autoconfiguration) untuk menetapkan alamat berdasarkan Router Advertisments."

#: netsetup:576
msgid "If you do not have a network card, select the 'loopback' choice."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak memiliki kartu jaringan, pilih opsi 'loopback'."

#: netsetup:578
msgid "Which type of network setup would you like?"
msgstr "Jenis pengaturan jaringan apa yang Anda inginkan?"

#: netsetup:590
msgid "Use a static IP address to configure ethernet"
msgstr "Gunakan alamat IP statis untuk mengonfigurasi ethernet"

#: netsetup:591
msgid "Use a DHCP server to configure ethernet"
msgstr "Gunakan server DHCP untuk mengonfigurasi ethernet"

#: netsetup:592
msgid "Autoconfigure network using NetworkManager"
msgstr "Konfigurasikan jaringan secara otomatis menggunakan NetworkManager"

#: netsetup:593
msgid "Use SLAAC to configure ethernet (IPv6 only)"
msgstr "Gunakan SLAAC untuk mengonfigurasi ethernet (khusus IPv6)"

#: netsetup:594
msgid "Set up a loopback connection (modem or no net)"
msgstr "Siapkan koneksi loopback (modem atau tanpa jaringan)"

#: netsetup:603
msgid "Please select the type of DHCP to use to configure your networking."
msgstr "Silakan pilih jenis DHCP yang akan digunakan untuk mengonfigurasi jaringan Anda."

#: netsetup:605
msgid ""
"Select 'DHCPv4' to configure for an IPv4 network (this is the most common "
"type of network, and the safe choice)."
msgstr "Pilih 'DHCPv4' untuk mengonfigurasi jaringan IPv4 (ini adalah jenis jaringan yang paling umum, dan pilihan yang aman)."

#: netsetup:607
msgid ""
"Select 'DHCPv6' for a pure IPv6 network, or 'Both' to try and set up both "
"types of network."
msgstr "Pilih 'DHCPv6' untuk jaringan IPv6 murni, atau 'Keduanya' untuk mencoba menyiapkan kedua jenis jaringan."

#: netsetup:612
msgid "SELECT DHCP TYPE"
msgstr "PILIH JENIS DHCP"

#: netsetup:614
msgid "An IPv4 based network, with no IPv6 configuration"
msgstr "Jaringan berbasis IPv4, tanpa konfigurasi IPv6"

#: netsetup:615
msgid "An IPv6 based network, with no IPv4 configuration"
msgstr "Jaringan berbasis IPv6, tanpa konfigurasi IPv4"

#: netsetup:616
msgid "Both"
msgstr "Keduanya"

#: netsetup:616
msgid "A combination of IPv4 and IPv6 networks"
msgstr "Kombinasi jaringan IPv4 dan IPv6"

#: netsetup:631
msgid ""
"Some network providers require that the DHCP hostname be set in order to "
"connect."
msgstr "Beberapa penyedia jaringan mengharuskan hostname DHCP diatur agar dapat terhubung."

#: netsetup:632
msgid ""
"If so, they'll have assigned a hostname to your machine, which may look "
"something like CC-NUMBER-A (this depends on your ISP)."
msgstr "Jika demikian, mereka akan menetapkan sebuah hostname untuk mesin Anda, yang mungkin terlihat seperti CC-NUMBER-A (ini bergantung pada ISP Anda)."

#: netsetup:633
msgid "If you were assigned a DHCP hostname, please enter it below."
msgstr "Jika Anda diberi hostname DHCP, silakan masukkan di bawah ini."

#: netsetup:634
msgid ""
"If you do not have a DHCP hostname, just leave it blank or select 'Skip'."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak memiliki hostname DHCP, biarkan kosong atau pilih 'Lewati'."

#: netsetup:635
msgid "SET DHCP HOSTNAME"
msgstr "ATUR HOSTNAME DHCP"

#: netsetup:665
msgid "Enter the IPv4 addresses for this host."
msgstr "Masukkan alamat IPv4 untuk host ini."

#: netsetup:666
msgid ""
"You may list one or more, space delimited, IPv4 addresses with netmasks in "
"the format:"
msgstr "Anda dapat mencantumkan satu atau lebih alamat IPv4 yang dipisahkan spasi dengan netmask dalam format:"

#: netsetup:668 netsetup:769
msgid "IP address"
msgstr "Alamat IP"

#: netsetup:668
msgid "CIDR netmask"
msgstr "Netmask CIDR"

#: netsetup:669
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "Misalnya:"

#: netsetup:671 netsetup:771
msgid "or"
msgstr "atau"

#: netsetup:672
msgid "Old style netmask 255.255.255.0 is equivalent of 24 in CIDR style."
msgstr "Netmask gaya lama 255.255.255.0 setara dengan 24 dalam gaya CIDR."

#: netsetup:673
msgid "If a netmask is not specified a default of 24 will be used."
msgstr "Jika netmask tidak ditentukan, nilai default 24 akan digunakan."

#: netsetup:675
msgid ""
"The first address entered will become the primary IPv4 address of this host."
msgstr "Alamat pertama yang dimasukkan akan menjadi alamat IPv4 utama host ini."

#: netsetup:676
msgid ""
"If you do not want to configure a static IPv4 address, just leave it blank "
"or select 'Skip'."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak ingin mengonfigurasi alamat IPv4 statis, biarkan kosong atau pilih 'Lewati'."

#: netsetup:677
msgid "ENTER IPv4 ADDRESSES"
msgstr "MASUKKAN ALAMAT IPv4"

#: netsetup:698
msgid "NO IPv4 ADDRESSES"
msgstr "TIDAK ADA ALAMAT IPv4"

#: netsetup:699 netsetup:795
msgid "No IP specified in entry:"
msgstr "Tidak ada IP yang ditentukan pada entri:"

#: netsetup:712
msgid "INVALID NETMASK"
msgstr "NETMASK TIDAK VALID"

#: netsetup:713
msgid "Invalid netmask specified for entry:"
msgstr "Netmask yang ditentukan tidak valid untuk entri:"

#: netsetup:714
msgid "Valid netmasks will be in the range 1-32."
msgstr "Netmask yang valid akan berada dalam rentang 1-32."

#: netsetup:732
msgid "ENTER IPv4 GATEWAY ADDRESS"
msgstr "MASUKKAN ALAMAT GATEWAY IPv4"

#: netsetup:733
msgid "Enter the address for the IPv4 gateway on your network, such as:"
msgstr "Masukkan alamat gateway IPv4 pada jaringan Anda, seperti:"

#: netsetup:736
msgid ""
"If you don't have an IPv4 gateway on your network, leave it blank or select "
"'Skip'."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak memiliki gateway IPv4 pada jaringan Anda, biarkan kosong atau pilih 'Lewati'."

#: netsetup:738
msgid "Enter IPv4 gateway address:"
msgstr "Masukkan alamat gateway IPv4:"

#: netsetup:765
msgid "ENTER IPv6 ADDRESSES"
msgstr "MASUKKAN ALAMAT IPv6"

#: netsetup:767
msgid "Enter the IPv6 addresses for this host."
msgstr "Masukkan alamat IPv6 untuk host ini."

#: netsetup:768
msgid ""
"You may list one or more, space delimited, IPv6 addresses with their "
"prefixes in the format:"
msgstr "Anda dapat mencantumkan satu atau lebih alamat IPv6 yang dipisahkan spasi beserta prefiksnya dalam format:"

#: netsetup:769
msgid "prefix"
msgstr "prefiks"

#: netsetup:770
msgid "For example"
msgstr "Misalnya"

#: netsetup:772
msgid "If a prefix is not specified a default of 64 will be used."
msgstr "Jika prefiks tidak ditentukan, nilai default 64 akan digunakan."

#: netsetup:774
msgid ""
"If you do not want to configure a static IPv6 address or don't know what to "
"put, just leave it blank or select 'Skip'."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak ingin mengonfigurasi alamat IPv6 statis atau tidak tahu harus mengisi apa, biarkan kosong atau pilih 'Lewati'."

#: netsetup:794
msgid "NO IPv6 ADDRESSES"
msgstr "TIDAK ADA ALAMAT IPv6"

#: netsetup:808
msgid "INVALID PREFIX"
msgstr "PREFIKS TIDAK VALID"

#: netsetup:809
msgid "Invalid prefix specified for entry:"
msgstr "Prefiks yang ditentukan tidak valid untuk entri:"

#: netsetup:810
msgid "Valid prefixes will be in the range 1-128."
msgstr "Prefiks yang valid akan berada dalam rentang 1-128."

#: netsetup:828
msgid "ENTER IPv6 GATEWAY ADDRESS"
msgstr "MASUKKAN ALAMAT GATEWAY IPv6"

#: netsetup:829
msgid "Enter the address for the IPv6 gateway on your network, such as:"
msgstr "Masukkan alamat gateway IPv6 pada jaringan Anda, seperti:"

#: netsetup:832
msgid ""
"If you don't have an IPv6 gateway on your network, leave it blank or select "
"'Skip'."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak memiliki gateway IPv6 pada jaringan Anda, biarkan kosong atau pilih 'Lewati'."

#: netsetup:834
msgid "Enter IPv6 gateway address:"
msgstr "Masukkan alamat gateway IPv6:"

#: netsetup:858
msgid "NO IP ADDRESSES"
msgstr "TIDAK ADA ALAMAT IP"

#: netsetup:859
msgid ""
"You have not configured any IP addresses for this host. Are you sure you "
"want to proceed with no IPs?"
msgstr "Anda belum mengonfigurasi alamat IP apa pun untuk host ini. Apakah Anda yakin ingin melanjutkan tanpa IP?"

#: netsetup:872
msgid "USE A NAMESERVER?"
msgstr "GUNAKAN NAMESERVER?"

#: netsetup:872
msgid "Will you be accessing a nameserver?"
msgstr "Apakah Anda akan mengakses nameserver?"

#: netsetup:895
msgid "ENTER NAMESERVER IP ADDRESS"
msgstr "MASUKKAN ALAMAT IP NAMESERVER"

#: netsetup:897
msgid "Please give the IP address of the name server to use, such as"
msgstr "Silakan berikan alamat IP name server yang akan digunakan, seperti"

#: netsetup:899
msgid "You can add more Domain Name Servers later by editing"
msgstr "Anda dapat menambahkan lebih banyak Domain Name Server nanti dengan mengedit"

#: netsetup:902
msgid "Primary name server to use:"
msgstr "Name server utama yang akan digunakan:"

#: netsetup:955
msgid "PROBE FOR NETWORK CARD?"
msgstr "PROBE UNTUK KARTU JARINGAN?"

#: netsetup:955
msgid ""
"If you like, we can look to see what kind of network card you have in your "
"machine, and if we find one create an /etc/rc.d/rc.netdevice script to load "
"the module for it at boot time.  There's a slight bit of danger that the "
"probing can cause problems, but it almost always works.  If you'd rather "
"configure your system manually, you can skip the probing process and edit "
"/etc/rc.d/rc.modules or /etc/modules.conf later to have it load the right "
"module."
msgstr "Jika Anda mau, kami dapat memeriksa jenis kartu jaringan yang ada di mesin Anda, dan jika kami menemukan satu, membuat skrip /etc/rc.d/rc.netdevice untuk memuat modulnya saat boot. Ada sedikit risiko bahwa proses probing dapat menimbulkan masalah, tetapi hampir selalu berhasil. Jika Anda lebih suka mengonfigurasi sistem Anda secara manual, Anda dapat melewati proses probing dan mengedit /etc/rc.d/rc.modules atau /etc/modules.conf nanti agar memuat modul yang tepat."

#: netsetup:963
msgid "probe"
msgstr "probe"

#: netsetup:963
msgid "look for network cards to set up"
msgstr "cari kartu jaringan untuk disiapkan"

#: netsetup:964 netsetup:971
msgid "skip"
msgstr "lewati"

#: netsetup:964
msgid "skip probe;  edit /etc/rc.d/rc.modules later"
msgstr "lewati probe; edit /etc/rc.d/rc.modules nanti"

#: netsetup:977 netsetup:994
msgid "CARD DETECTED"
msgstr "KARTU TERDETEKSI"

#: netsetup:977 netsetup:994
#, sh-format
msgid "A networking card using the $card.o module has been detected."
msgstr "Sebuah kartu jaringan yang menggunakan modul $card.o telah terdeteksi."

#: netsetup:1002
msgid "NO CARD DETECTED"
msgstr "TIDAK ADA KARTU TERDETEKSI"

#: netsetup:1002
msgid ""
"Sorry, but no network card could be probed for on your system.  Some cards "
"(like non-PCI NE2000s) must be supplied with the I/O address to use and "
"can't be probed for safely. You'll have to try to configure the card later "
"by editing /etc/rc.d/rc.modules or recompiling your kernel."
msgstr "Maaf, tetapi tidak ada kartu jaringan yang dapat diprobe pada sistem Anda. Beberapa kartu (seperti NE2000 non-PCI) harus diberi alamat I/O yang akan digunakan dan tidak dapat diprobe dengan aman. Anda harus mencoba mengonfigurasi kartu tersebut nanti dengan mengedit /etc/rc.d/rc.modules atau mengompilasi ulang kernel Anda."

#: netsetup:1012 netsetup:1023 netsetup:1033
msgid "NETWORK SETUP COMPLETE"
msgstr "PENGATURAN JARINGAN SELESAI"

#: netsetup:1012
msgid "Your networking system is now configured to use loopback:"
msgstr "Sistem jaringan Anda sekarang dikonfigurasi untuk menggunakan loopback:"

#: netsetup:1015 netsetup:1038 netsetup:1106
msgid "IP addresses"
msgstr "Alamat IP"

#: netsetup:1017
msgid "Is this correct?  Press 'Yes' to continue, or 'No' to abandon."
msgstr "Apakah ini benar? Tekan 'Ya' untuk melanjutkan, atau 'Tidak' untuk membatalkan."

#: netsetup:1024
msgid ""
"Your networking system is now configured to use NetworkManager for wired and"
" wireless network management."
msgstr "Sistem jaringan Anda sekarang dikonfigurasi untuk menggunakan NetworkManager untuk pengelolaan jaringan kabel dan nirkabel."

#: netsetup:1025
msgid ""
"To set up wireless networks and view status, add the Network Management "
"control panel widget to your desktop."
msgstr "Untuk menyiapkan jaringan nirkabel dan melihat status, tambahkan widget panel kontrol Manajemen Jaringan ke desktop Anda."

#: netsetup:1027
msgid "Is this correct?  Press 'Yes' to confirm, or 'No' to abandon."
msgstr "Apakah ini benar? Tekan 'Ya' untuk mengonfirmasi, atau 'Tidak' untuk membatalkan."

#: netsetup:1034
msgid "Your system is now set up to autoconfigure an IPv6 IP address:"
msgstr "Sistem Anda sekarang disiapkan untuk mengonfigurasi otomatis alamat IP IPv6:"

#: netsetup:1035 netsetup:1058 netsetup:1070 netsetup:1102
msgid "Hostname"
msgstr "Hostname"

#: netsetup:1036
msgid "Domain name"
msgstr "Nama domain"

#: netsetup:1037 netsetup:1039 netsetup:1104 netsetup:1105
msgid "none"
msgstr "tidak ada"

#: netsetup:1038
msgid "use IPv6 SLAAC"
msgstr "gunakan SLAAC IPv6"

#: netsetup:1039 netsetup:1065 netsetup:1084 netsetup:1109
msgid "Nameserver"
msgstr "Nameserver"

#: netsetup:1041
msgid "If this is correct, hit 'Yes' to confirm, or 'No' to abandon."
msgstr "Jika ini benar, tekan 'Ya' untuk mengonfirmasi, atau 'Tidak' untuk membatalkan."

#: netsetup:1048
msgid "CONFIRM NETWORK SETUP"
msgstr "KONFIRMASI PENGATURAN JARINGAN"

#: netsetup:1049
msgid "Accept"
msgstr "Terima"

#: netsetup:1050
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Edit"

#: netsetup:1051
msgid "Abandon"
msgstr "Batalkan"

#: netsetup:1053
msgid "These are the settings you have entered."
msgstr "Berikut adalah pengaturan yang telah Anda masukkan."

#: netsetup:1054
msgid "To accept them and complete the networking setup, press ENTER."
msgstr "Untuk menerimanya dan menyelesaikan pengaturan jaringan, tekan ENTER."

#: netsetup:1055
msgid ""
"If you need to make any changes, you can do that now using 'Edit' (or "
"reconfigure later using 'netsetup')."
msgstr "Jika Anda perlu melakukan perubahan, Anda dapat melakukannya sekarang menggunakan 'Edit' (atau mengonfigurasi ulang nanti menggunakan 'netsetup')."

#: netsetup:1059 netsetup:1072 netsetup:1103
msgid "Domain Name"
msgstr "Nama Domain"

#: netsetup:1061 netsetup:1076
msgid "IPv4 Addresses"
msgstr "Alamat IPv4"

#: netsetup:1062 netsetup:1078
msgid "IPv4 Gateway"
msgstr "Gateway IPv4"

#: netsetup:1063 netsetup:1080
msgid "IPv6 Addresses"
msgstr "Alamat IPv6"

#: netsetup:1064 netsetup:1082
msgid "IPv6 Gateway"
msgstr "Gateway IPv6"

#: netsetup:1099
msgid "CONFIRM SETUP COMPLETE"
msgstr "KONFIRMASI PENYIAPAN SELESAI"

#: netsetup:1100
#, sh-format
msgid "Your networking system is now configured to use DHCP"
msgstr "Sistem jaringan Anda sekarang dikonfigurasi untuk menggunakan DHCP"

#: netsetup:1105
msgid "DHCP hostname"
msgstr "Hostname DHCP"

#: netsetup:1106 netsetup:1107 netsetup:1108 netsetup:1109
msgid "use DHCP server"
msgstr "gunakan server DHCP"

#: netsetup:1107
msgid "Netmask & Prefix"
msgstr "Netmask & Prefiks"

#: netsetup:1108
msgid "Gateways"
msgstr "Gateway"

#: netsetup:1111
msgid "Is this correct?  Press 'Yes' to continue, or 'No' to reconfigure."
msgstr "Apakah ini benar? Tekan 'Ya' untuk melanjutkan, atau 'Tidak' untuk mengonfigurasi ulang."

#: netsetup:1128
msgid "Settings accepted.  Basic network configuration is complete."
msgstr "Pengaturan diterima. Konfigurasi jaringan dasar selesai."

#: netsetup:1130
msgid ""
"Settings discarded.  Run the 'netsetup' command again if you need to "
"reconfigure your network settings."
msgstr "Pengaturan dibuang. Jalankan perintah 'netsetup' lagi jika Anda perlu mengonfigurasi ulang pengaturan jaringan Anda."

#: setup.netsetup:36
msgid "CONFIGURE NETWORK?"
msgstr "KONFIGURASI JARINGAN?"

#: setup.netsetup:36
msgid "Would you like to configure your network?"
msgstr "Apakah Anda ingin mengonfigurasi jaringan Anda?"
